&gt;&gt; Absolutely.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:57.240
After Bob and I wrote this
a book on scaling up excellence,

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:02.570
one of the things we thought we really
needed to think and develop tools,

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:07.990
and Bob spearheaded the idea of a project
